sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant E as ESTS
  participant U as User phone
  Note over C,E: arrUserProofs contains OneWaySMS or ConsolidatedTelephony<br/>(display carries a masked phone number)
  C->>E: POST /common/SAS/BeginAuth  header canary
  Note over C,E: {AuthMethodId: OneWaySMS | ConsolidatedTelephony, Method: BeginAuth,<br/>ctx, flowToken}
  E-->>C: 200 {Success: true, FlowToken, Ctx, SessionId}
  E-)U: SMS code (out of band)
  U-->>C: SMS code
  C->>E: POST /common/SAS/EndAuth (JSON)  header canary
  Note over C,E: {AdditionalAuthData: smsCode, AuthMethodId, SessionId, FlowToken, Ctx,<br/>Method: EndAuth}
  E-->>C: 200 {Success: true, FlowToken, Ctx}
  C->>E: POST /common/SAS/ProcessAuth (form)
  Note over C,E: mfaAuthMethod=OneWaySMS  (even when the method was<br/>ConsolidatedTelephony)
  E-->>C: 302 code, or 200 interrupt HTML
